 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2026-02-11",
   "text": "Firearm Safety Act of 2025\nThis bill allows the Consumer Product Safety Commission (CPSC) to issue safety standards for firearms and firearm components.\nUnder current law, firearms, shells, cartridges, and components thereof are excluded from the CPSC's rulemaking authority."
  }
